 "comment": "Reference vectors for the DNS rule table (front/sink_dns.go dnsRuleSet). The Cloud worker's DNS helper must give the same answers: its test loads this file. Rules are added in order; Match is case-insensitive and ignores one trailing dot; wildcards match one or more labels under the suffix, never the suffix itself; an exact rule beats a wildcard and a longer wildcard beats a shorter one; a name that is not a plain DNS name (an address, empty, a NUL, a doubled dot) is refused. The default target (an unmatched name) is sink.",
